This repository releases the model code and configurations for Forma on the
ProForma-20Q benchmark, plus code and configurations for the competitor models.
Scoring is performed by the companion package `proforma-20q`.

This product includes the Fama-French 48 industry SIC classification derived
from the Kenneth R. French Data Library.

The Chronos-2 driver uses the `amazon/chronos-2` foundation model (Apache-2.0),
downloaded from the Hugging Face Hub at runtime; no Chronos weights are
distributed here.

NO DATA IS DISTRIBUTED. WRDS / Compustat / CRSP credentials and license are the
user's responsibility; see README.md. Reproduction on real data requires
building the ProForma-20Q dataset with the companion package.
